SUMMARY:YO: Love Is A Rebellious Bird
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 204 Massachusetts Ave\, Arlington\, MA 02474
DESCRIPTION:After the death of her close friend Yo\, filmmaker Anna Fitch s
 pends ten years constructing a meticulous one-third-scale replica of Yo’
 s home where a puppet version of Yo “lives\,” allowing Anna to revisit
  their unlikely\, decades-long friendship that began when Yo was 73 and An
 na 24. Blending intimate vérité footage from Yo’s final year with…\n
 https://www.capitoltheatreusa.com/movie/yo-love-is-a-rebellious-bird/\nFro
 m Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
